   ⚠️  More than one convention. Case matters: `barLengthMs("1M")` falls back to
       ONE DAY (case-sensitive map) while a `/i` parser reads ONE MINUTE. Do not pass
       an uppercase label into a duration path — pass the canonical lowercase value.

